---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Website Developer for Small Businesses | Simon Morgan"
    description="Freelance web developer helping small businesses get a fast, professional website. 18+ years' experience. Clear process, one point of contact, no jargon">
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid grid--compact">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--10">
                    <h1 class="mb-1">Fast, Professional Websites <br />for Small Businesses</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8">
                    <p class="text-lg">
                        I build fast, professional websites for small businesses - from a simple online presence to a fully custom site you can update yourself.
                        You deal with one experienced developer from first call to launch.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--padded bg-blue-dark color-white mb-0">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid grid--compact">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--10">
                    <h2 class="mb-1">What you get</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8">
                    <ul class="flow">
                        <li>
                            <strong>A site that looks professional and loads fast</strong> Built with modern, lightweight tools - no bloated themes slowing you down
                            or hurting your Google ranking.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Something you can actually manage</strong> Whether that's a simple content management system (WordPress) or a fully custom build,
                            you'll be able to update text, images and pages yourself without calling me every time.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Mobile-friendly, accessible by default</strong> Your site will work properly on phones and be usable by all visitors - including
                            those relying on screen readers or other assistive tech.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>SEO groundwork done properly</strong> Clean code, sensible page structure and fast load times - the foundations that help you
                            show up in Google search from day one.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid grid--compact">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--10">
                    <h2 class="mb-1">How it works</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8">
                    <ul class="flow">
                        <li>
                            <strong>Free initial chat</strong> - tell me about your business and what you need the site to do.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Fixed-scope proposal</strong> - a clear plan and cost, no surprises later.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Design & build</strong> - regular updates so you're never left wondering what's happening.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Launch & handover</strong> - a walkthrough so you're confident managing the site yourself, plus support if you need it after.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="get-in-touch" class="section section--padded bg-blue-dark color-white mb-0">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8 flow">
                    <h2 class="h1">Get in touch</h2>
                    <p>Ready to get your business online - or fix up what you've already got?</p>
                    <p>
                        <a href="/contact" class="button button--secondary">Get in touch</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
